  "description": "No. 13 Errigal House is a beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment, ideally situated within this quiet and well-maintained residential development in the heart of Donnybrook. Benefitting from a desirable dual aspect, the apartment is filled with natural light and enjoys a peaceful setting within mature landscaped grounds, while being just a short stroll from the excellent amenities of Dublin 4.\n\nThe well-appointed accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, two spacious double bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with en-suite, a bright living and dining area, a contemporary fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances and a modern main bathroom.\n\nCombining a practical layout, quality finishes and an unrivalled location, No. 13 Errigal House offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a stylish and low-maintenance home in one of Dublin’s most sought-after residential addresses.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nLiving/Dining/Living: (6.65m x 3.44m) Wood flooring, bright orientation, radiator and electrical points. Array of wall and floor units, quartz worktops, integrated oven, hob, fridge/freezer, dishwasher and stainless steel sink.\n\nBedroom 1: (3.33m x 3.59m) Carpet flooring, built in wardrobe, radiator and electrical points.\n\nEn Suite: (2.17m x 1.57m) Tiled wall and floor, wc, whb and shower.\n\nBedroom 2: (3.82m x 3.01m) Carpet flooring, built in wardrobe, radiator and electrical points.\n\nBathroom: (2.17m x 2.06m) Tiled wall and floor, wc, whb and shower.\n\nLOCATION OVERVIEW\n\nEglinton Road enjoys an exceptional position in the heart of Donnybrook, one of Dublin 4’s most sought-after residential addresses. This mature, tree-lined setting offers a perfect balance of peaceful suburban living and immediate access to the vibrant amenities of Dublin city.\nExceptional Connectivity\n\nThe area benefits from excellent transport links, with numerous Dublin Bus routes providing easy access to the city centre, UCD, Ballsbridge and surrounding areas. The DART stations at Sandymount and Sydney Parade, along with the Luas Green Line at Beechwood, are all within easy reach, while the nearby N11 and M50 ensure convenient access to Dublin Airport and regional routes.\n\nLifestyle, Dining & Amenities\n\nDonnybrook offers an exceptional lifestyle with a vibrant café culture, excellent restaurants and a wealth of amenities on its doorstep. The neighbouring areas of Ranelagh, Ballsbridge and Sandymount further enhance the social and culinary offering with renowned eateries, wine bars and cafés.\n\nResidents benefit from excellent recreational facilities, including Herbert Park, Donnybrook Stadium, boutique gyms and leisure clubs. Everyday conveniences are well catered for with premium supermarkets, speciality food stores, independent boutiques and essential services nearby. The area is also home to prestigious schools and enjoys close proximity to Trinity College Dublin and University College Dublin.\n\nA Prime Dublin 4 Address\n\nAn Exceptional Place to Call Home\nCombining the charm of a mature residential setting with the convenience of a prime Dublin 4 location, Eglinton Road offers a unique opportunity to enjoy a refined and well-connected lifestyle in one of Dublin’s most desirable neighbourhoods.",
  "features": [
    "BEAUTIFULLY PRESENTED TWO-BEDROOM, TWO-BATHROOM APARTMENT",
